      text: 'PJM capacity prices jumped from $28.92/MW-day (2024/25) to $269.92/MW-day (2025/26), and the next auction (2026/27) hit the $329.17/MW-day price cap. The independent market monitor estimated data center load was responsible for 63% of the price increase — about $9.3 billion in costs passed to customers. PJM serves about 65 million people in 13 states + D.C.',
